    {
      "id": "dbcc650a-bca3-5726-9a7c-e7150e346868",
      "name": "Setup and recovery",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "height": 350,
        "width": 1040,
        "content": "## Manual first; no automatic schedule\nSelect HTTP Header Auth on every HTTP node: Authorization = Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN. Default:10 requested US records with stored Shopify and email fields. 1 site = 1 paid result, not 1 email. Limit is not guaranteed coverage.\n\nCSV works without Google credentials. For Sheets: create a Leads tab with the supplied headers, select Google Sheets OAuth on Upsert by domain, replace spreadsheet ID, set sendToGoogleSheets=true. Values use RAW mode.\n\n## Recover without a new paid run\nCopy the original run ID from Start Actor to resumeRunId, then execute manually. No automatic POST retry. Review source errors before retrying. MAX_ITEMS_REACHED is an intentional limited sample; not a complete audience export. Larger-than1000 datasets are rejected. $0.15 is an event cap, not a guarantee about all platform/proxy costs. No hidden telemetry."
      }
    }
